    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse Gamepack offers AI-powered Personalized Spatial Audio, headtracking, and custom EQ for 100+ headphones to deliver ultra-immersive sound in Cyberpunk 2077 and The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt. Hear the game world exactly as you were meant to!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse Gamepack offers AI-powered Personalized Spatial Audio, headtracking, and custom EQ for 100+ headphones to deliver ultra-immersive sound in Cyberpunk 2077 and The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt. Hear the game world exactly as you were meant to!</p>",
    "short_description": "Immerse Gamepack expands the soundscape of Cyberpunk 2077 and The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt with stunning realism and 360\u00b0 precision. Developed in collaboration with the CD Projekt RED sound team, this standalone spatial audio app brings every moment to life.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish",
    "reviews": "\u201cAfter hearing the way our game sounds with Immerse, I can't go back\u201d<br>Krzysztof Popiel, CD Projekt Red<br><br>\u201cI\u2019ve never heard the Continent like this before! The sense of space feels incredibly natural, and the sound positioning is spot on. If you want to experience Cyberpunk 2077 and The Witcher 3 on a whole new level, you should definitely try the Immerse Gamepack!\u201d<br>Marcin Przyby\u0142owicz, Composer for The Witcher 3: Wild Hunt<br>",
